<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/6th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Gothic War (535–554)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">535–554</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Gothic War was fought from 535 to 554 between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/byzantine-empire">Byzantine Empire</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/justinian-i">Justinian I</a> and the Ostrogothic <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-italy">Kingdom of Italy</a>. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/belisarius">Belisarius</a> took <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> and Ravenna by 540, but the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/goths">Goths</a> recovered under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/totila">Totila</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/narses">Narses</a> finally defeated them at Taginae (552) and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mons">Mons</a> Lactarius, and the long war devastated <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a>, much of which soon fell to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-the-lombards">Lombards</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/gothic-war-535-554.jpg" alt="Gothic War (535–554)" width="320" height="242" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: The original uploader was Captain Blood at German Wikipedia. · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gothic_Battle_of_Mons_Lactarius_on_Vesuvius.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
